sts regular research seminars and international workshops, with faculty publishing in top-ranked journals. We look forward to welcoming colleagues who will contribute to this agenda and to the education of the next generation of analytically minded managers. For further information: https://www.skema.edu/ #WeAreSKEMA Rejoignez-nous ! © 2026 Skema BS e-recruiting Nos offres d'emploi Conditions d'utilisation Protection des données Utilisation des cookies"
